# --- Private / sensitive Claude Code data (never commit) ---
# Allowlist, nao denylist: o Claude Code cria diretorios privados novos a cada
# versao (sessions, projects, shell-snapshots, ...). Enumerar o que excluir faz
# com que qualquer diretorio futuro entre no commit por omissao. Aqui o padrao e
# ignorar tudo em .claude/ e liberar so o que e config versionada.
.claude/*
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json

.claude-mem/
**/.claude-mem/

# --- opencode ---
.opencode/
opencode/node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# --- Environment / secrets ---
.env
.env.*
*.local
credentials*.json
*.key
*.pem

# --- Antigravity private data ---
antigravity/staging/
antigravity/*.local*

# --- Selecao de skills gerada pelo site (local) ---
claude/skills-selection.txt

# --- Gerado por scripts/crawl-anthropic-skills.ps1 (ruido para o grafo) ---
docs/DISCOVERED_SKILLS.md

# --- graphify (grafo local gerado, nao versionado) ---
graphify-out/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
